<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dial price target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dial price target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it raised its price target on Dial Corp to $18 a share from $16 a share.</p>
<p>-- said it maintained its buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said the earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 remains $0.90 a share.  Quarterly estimates for 1997 were adjusted, but the analyst declined to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- said Dial should &quot;progress nicely&quot; in 1997 through cost reductions and brand investments.</p>
</text>
